<title>PERU: Banco de Credito Q1 net rises.</title>
<headline>Banco de Credito Q1 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>LIMA 1997-04-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Share - n.a.</p>
<p>Net - 71.4 million soles vs 55.7 million soles</p>
<p>Revs - 216.6 million soles vs 169 million soles</p>
<p>NOTES: Banco de Credito, Peru's leading bank, is 90.1 percent-owned by Credicorp Ltd.</p>
<p>((-- Lima newsroom, 511 221-2134))</p>
